links","field","originalImage","label","Original creator image","items",[63],{"_59":60,"_25":64},"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/main/docs/media/02-half-pipe-air.jpg","text","mediaReviewed","Screenshot source reviewed","value","2026-10-20","image","gameplay","The creator’s actual half-pipe gameplay frame, with the skater and the procedural park.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/golden-hour-skatepark-cursor.webp","alt","A skater is airborne above a half-pipe in a palm-lined skatepark under a warm evening sky.","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park#readme","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)",[88],"Cursor","Related resources",[93,94],"resourceIds","section",{"_59":97,"_25":98},{"_59":95,"_25":96},"Blender","/resources/blender/","Three.js","/resources/threejs/","Creator evidence",[102],"evidence",{"_59":103,"_25":104,"_105":106},"Read the creator’s Cursor contribution account","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park#how-it-was-built","note","The README explicitly names Cursor AI agents and separates builder passes, critic feedback and human playtests; docs/MAKING-OF.md provides a detailed account. Source-checked; performance and playability claims were not reproduced.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[111],{"_59":112,"_25":113,"_105":114},"Open the complete skating project","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park","Complete TypeScript game, procedural park code, runtime skater/crowd GLBs, textures, audio and source tools. CI uses Node 22 and pnpm 10.18.0; pnpm install then pnpm dev at 127.0.0.1:5188. Ports are fixed. No root LICENSE was found; CC0 media, Mixamo animations and dependencies keep separate terms.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[120],{"_59":121,"_25":122,"_105":123},"Play Golden Hour Skatepark","https://starknightt.github.io/skate-park/","Browser skating sandbox with keyboard, optional mouse/gamepad and touch controls. Press any key, click or tap to take over from the title-screen rider. Phone testing reported by the creator used desktop emulation; Firefox and desktop Safari remain untested.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[131],{"_59":132,"_25":133,"_105":-7},"Read the builder-and-critic development account","https://github.com/StarKnightt/skate-park/blob/main/docs/MAKING-OF.md","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[138,139,140,141],"Play the park and test pushing, carving, one trick, a bail and recovery.","Read the making-of account and separate human feedback, agent implementation and third-party assets.","Use Node 22 with pnpm 10.18.0, then pnpm install and pnpm dev; inspect the collision mesh and character pipeline.","Ask an agent to adjust one movement or camera parameter, then compare transition riding, tricks and recovery across the park.","AI workflow / foundation context","The author says Cursor AI agents implemented the game through builder and visual-critic passes, with human playtests refining controls. Code-built environments and procedural riding are combined with Cursor-generated artwork, credited CC0 audio/textures and Mixamo recovery animations.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","provenance","Track","3D","track","metadata","Asset creation tools",false,[95],"assetTools","Engine","Three.js · TypeScript","engine","lead",[95],"3d","ai-assisted",[138,139,140,141],{"_59":132,"_25":133,"_17":175},{"_59":121,"_25":122,"_17":116,"_105":123},{"_59":112,"_25":113,"_173":174,"_105":114},{"_59":103,"_25":104,"_105":106},[171,172],"threejs","blender","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_177":178},"documents",{"_179":180,"_181":182},"en",[184,188,189,190,187,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,186,223,185,224,22